The companion sends anonymous usage counts to Umami, with a switch in Settings.

Joe, 2026-11-14: how many people use Brighter Pocket Companion, which setup step they reach and
where they stop. App/Core/Analytics.swift (pocket/management/Analytics.swift) sends them: the step
on screen as a page view (/companion/<step>), and the companion opened, a step left with Continue,
the kind of Apple Account and device chosen, and each job's outcome with its diagnosis's title.
Never an Apple Account, team or device name, a Steam account or anything of the game's. On by
default, said on the welcome step; Settings > General turns it off.
Upstream note: Brighter Pocket's own; Tolkara Management sends nothing.

